    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MARIA: So?\nBRUNA: It was magnificent.\nMARIA: Thank you.",
      "MARIA: Today, on a bridge, I made a decision...\nBRUNA: The dogs were afraid of the loud noise.\nMARIA: Did you buy what I asked for?",
      "BRUNA: It was a dull day, I imagine.\nMARIA: Good. The piano is much better there. Both of you. Put on nicer clothes...\nMARIA: We are going to celebrate my life...",
      "MARIA: Where to now?\nBRUNA: We are tired, Madam.\nBRUNA: And we are worried.",
      "MARIA: It took a great deal of effort for me to enter this restaurant. I had to say a magic spell.\nYAKINTHI: Since I sent you the medication, I have bee n regretting it.\nMARIA: I have no regrets. How do I look?\nYAKINTHI: Too thin."
    ]
  },
